    "detailed_description": "GAME TO PLAY WHILE WAITING FOR QUEUE<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to the world of CUBE, where simplicity meets sophistication. Easy to pick up but challenging to master, this game offers a relaxing and immersive experience that tests your skills while soothing your mind.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has no end, it was made for relaxation and infinite play with a calm soundtrack that I will expand and continue to add music, obstacles, and quality of life. This game was designed to be played casually, to pass the time, to relax, or even to get stressed haha.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI hope you can spend a lot of time playing and relaxing, collect cubes, try to stay alive for a long time or whatever, just listen to the music, play your way, and be happy<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Easy to Play, Hard to Master: <br />\r\n-Quickly grasp intuitive controls while diving into increasingly complex challenges.<br />\r\n-Lo-Fi Soundtrack: Immerse yourself in a relaxing atmosphere with a unique lo-fi soundtrack, perfect for accompanying your journey in the game.<br />\r\n-Procedural World: Explore a procedurally generated universe, ensuring each gaming session is unique and surprising.<br />\r\n-Minimalist and Stylish Environment: Delight in minimalist graphics that blend elegance with a modern, clean aesthetic.<br />\r\nCollect Cubes: Embark on a mission to collect cubes<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThings to be added in the future:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Greater variety of obstacles<br />\r\n-Narration and backstory",
